# Generated from teacher geometry; same a=3.615 A and EAM file.
units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
lattice fcc 3.615 orient x 1 0 0 orient y 0 1 0 orient z 0 0 1
Lattice spacing in x,y,z = 3.615 3.615 3.615
region box block 0 6 0 6 0 6
create_box 1 box
Created orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (21.69 21.69 21.69)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
create_atoms 1 box
Created 864 atoms
  using lattice units in orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (21.69 21.69 21.69)
  create_atoms CPU = 0.000 seconds
pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * CuYM.eam.alloy Cu
Reading eam/alloy potential file CuYM.eam.alloy with DATE: 2007-10-12
neighbor 0.3 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
compute pea all pe/atom
thermo 20
thermo_style custom step atoms pe lx ly lz press fmax fnorm
thermo_modify format float %.16g

min_style cg
min_modify dmax 0.1
minimize 0.0 1e-8 10000 100000
